 {
  "type": "post",
  "id": "7513935180982812672",
  "linkedinUrl": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/pentagram_design-doha-biennial-is-the-largest-platform-activity-7513935180982812672-rpqF",
  "content": "Design Doha Biennial is the largest platform for design in the Arab region. For its 2026 edition, Pentagram Partner Samar Maakaroun and team have designed a new identity centred on the idea of connection at every level.\n\nThe identity functions as a flexible typographic system designed to express relationships between people, languages and disciplines with a bilingual structure that gives equal presence to Arabic and English. The two scripts are treated with parity, united in a shared typographic composition rather than as separate elements, reinforcing the Biennial’s role as a bridge between different cultures. \n\nRead the full case study here: https://lnkd.in/eJSxB6S6",
